  "description": "Expanding Horizon 8.0 – Software Organized by: Student Mentorship Program (SMP), MNNIT Allahabad Expanding Horizon 8.0 – Software is an initiative by the Student Mentorship Program (SMP), MNNIT Allahabad, aimed at helping aspiring software engineers prepare for the upcoming internship season. The assessment focuses on evaluating participants' programming skills, data structures and algorithms, logical reasoning, and problem-solving abilities. It provides an opportunity to challenge oneself through coding problems inspired by the technical assessments commonly encountered during software internship recruitment. Objectives Strengthen programming and coding proficiency. Evaluate understanding of Data Structures and Algorithms. Improve logical thinking and algorithmic problem-solving. Develop the ability to solve problems efficiently under time constraints. Assess technical preparation for software engineering internships. Guidelines The assessment will be conducted online through Unstop. Participants must attempt the questions within the stipulated time. Submissions will be evaluated based on correctness and predefined evaluation criteria. Plagiarism, code sharing, or any unfair means are strictly prohibited. The decision of the organizing team will be final. Learn. Code. Compete. Get Internship Ready!",
