    "details": "<p><strong>Expanding Horizon 8.0 &ndash; Software</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Organized by: Student Mentorship Program (SMP), MNNIT Allahabad</strong></p>\n<p>Expanding Horizon 8.0 &ndash; Software is an initiative by the Student Mentorship Program (SMP), MNNIT Allahabad, aimed at helping aspiring software engineers prepare for the upcoming internship season.</p>\n<p>The assessment focuses on evaluating participants' programming skills, data structures and algorithms, logical reasoning, and problem-solving abilities. It provides an opportunity to challenge oneself through coding problems inspired by the technical assessments commonly encountered during software internship recruitment.</p>\n<p><strong>Objectives</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Strengthen programming and coding proficiency.</li>\n<li>Evaluate understanding of Data Structures and Algorithms.</li>\n<li>Improve logical thinking and algorithmic problem-solving.</li>\n<li>Develop the ability to solve problems efficiently under time constraints.</li>\n<li>Assess technical preparation for software engineering internships.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Guidelines</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The assessment will be conducted online through Unstop.</li>\n<li>Participants must attempt the questions within the stipulated time.</li>\n<li>Submissions will be evaluated based on correctness and predefined evaluation criteria.</li>\n<li>Plagiarism, code sharing, or any unfair means are strictly prohibited.</li>\n<li>The decision of the organizing team will be final.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Learn. Code. Compete. Get Internship Ready!</strong></p>",
